    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700403/1017004030210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\n──それとな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『新しいことをやってみる』────……\r\nあの時は思いつきで言ったんだけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今はちょっと、\r\nありじゃないかって思い始めてる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004030220,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700403/1017004030220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この前、あさひとあの川に行って、風景って\r\n飽きないなって思ったんだ。あさひもだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004030230,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "そっすね\r\n色んなものあって面白かったっす",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700403/1017004030230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん。それはたぶん、\r\n川も空も人も電車も、みんな移り変わるから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "変わっていくものは、輝くんだ\r\nきっと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1017004030240,
    "speaker": "あさひ",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_serious_s",
    "charLabel": "asahi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101700403/1017004030240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あさひもそうだ\r\n変わっていくことは、あさひの輝きになる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
